     "text": "",
     "dur": 0.6,
     "cam": "wide",
     "sfx": "bell"
    },
    {
     "who": "narrator",
     "text": "In Kampilya lived a learned priest, Yajnadatta, honoured by the king. He had one son, Gunanidhi, handsome as the moon.",
     "text_hi": "काम्पिल्य में यज्ञदत्त नाम के एक विद्वान पुरोहित रहते थे, जिनका राजा भी आदर करते थे। उनका एक ही पुत्र था, गुणनिधि, चंद्रमा जैसा सुंदर।",
     "cam": "wide"
    },
    {
     "who": "narrator",
     "text": "But Gunanidhi had a secret. He gambled. And he lost. Every single day.",
     "text_hi": "पर गुणनिधि का एक रहस्य था। वह जुआ खेलता था। और हारता था। हर दिन।",
     "cam": "mid:gunanidhi"
    },
    {
     "who": "yajnadatta",
     "text": "Where is our son? I never see him at home.",
     "text_hi": "हमारा पुत्र कहाँ है? मैं उसे कभी घर पर नहीं देखता।",
     "cam": "mid:yajnadatta"
    },
    {
     "who": "mother",
     "text": "He has just gone out to study, with two or three friends.",
     "text_hi": "अभी-अभी पढ़ने गया है, दो-तीन मित्रों के साथ।",
     "cam": "mid:mother"
    },
    {
     "who": "narrator",
     "text": "She loved her only son, so she lied, again and again. And Gunanidhi carried off pots, clothes and jewels to the gambling dens.",
     "text_hi": "वह अपने इकलौते बेटे से प्रेम करती थी, इसलिए बार-बार झूठ बोलती रही। और गुणनिधि बर्तन, कपड़े और गहने उठाकर जुआघरों में ले जाता रहा।",
     "camMove": true,
     "cam": "wide",
     "capPos": "bottom"
    }
   ],
