    {
     "who": "yajnadatta",
     "text": "That is my ring! Where did you get it, thief?",
     "text_hi": "वह मेरी अंगूठी है! तुम्हें यह कहाँ से मिली, चोर?",
     "cam": "mid:yajnadatta"
    },
    {
     "who": "gambler",
     "text": "Thief? Your son gave it to me, priest. He has given us half your house. Did you not know?",
     "text_hi": "चोर? यह तो तुम्हारे बेटे ने दी है, पुरोहित जी। वह आधा घर हमें दे चुका है। आपको पता नहीं था?",
     "cam": "mid:gambler"
    },
    {
     "who": "narrator",
     "text": "Yajnadatta covered his head in shame and walked home.",
     "text_hi": "यज्ञदत्त ने लज्जा से सिर ढक लिया और घर लौट आए।",
     "cam": "close:yajnadatta",
